Description: Implements the Robust Angle-based Joint and Individual Variation
    Explained (RAJIVE) estimator for matched multi-view data, extending the
    original RaJIVE method of Ponzi et al. (2021)
    <https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2101.09110>. Provides robust singular value
    decomposition, joint and individual component estimation, diagnostic
    visualization, feature-level jackstraw-style testing, metadata association,
    and stability summaries. Native missing-data fitting and fixed-score
    jackstraw inference are experimental.
